                </field>
                <field>
                  <name>POS_COEFF_SEL</name>
                  <description>Positive Input Coefficient Select
The result from this channel is OFFEST and GAIN corrected using the coefficients in the selected CHAN_COEFFn register
If DIFFERENTIAL_EN is selected, select both a POS and NEG coefficient selection in this CHAN_CFG, the POS COEFF applied to the even sampler result, and NEG COEFF applied to the odd sampler result, prior to the subtraction.</description>
                  <bitRange>[11:8]</bitRange>
