SDR3  uses this register field for determining the extended SCL low phase.</description>
                <bitRange>[23:16]</bitRange>
              </field>
              <field>
                <name>I3C_EXT_LCNT_4</name>
                <description>I3C Extended Low Count Register 4

SDR4 uses this register field for determining the extended SCL low phase.</description>
                <bitRange>[31:24]</bitRange>
