            <field>
              <name>ENABLED</name>
              <description>I3C Block Pre-Enable

When disabled, all write accesses to the I3C configuration registers are ignored.
Enable this prior to starting the configuration of the I3C block.

Values:
    0x0: Disable the I3C block
    0x1: Pre-Enable the I3C block</description>
